5
00:00:22,580 --> 00:00:29,420
Northern Irish songwriter from Belfast who moved to Sydney, Australia.

6
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:33,840
And became a worship leader in 2013 with Hillsong Worship.

7
00:00:33,840 --> 00:00:39,300
Now, I don't know how many of you are familiar with Hillsong and their journey.

8
00:00:39,300 --> 00:00:52,720
But when the church was first planted in the late 1980s, within 30 years, they had expanded 30 countries, over 150,000 congregants.

9
00:00:53,820 --> 00:01:03,280
In just one year in the U.S., their songs are streamed about 1.1 billion times annually.

10
00:01:05,680 --> 00:01:14,960
Some of you are familiar with the song, What a Beautiful Name, 343 million YouTube views on just that one song.

11
00:01:14,960 --> 00:01:22,600
2019, $93 million of revenue.

12
00:01:25,600 --> 00:01:30,880
This young man, this gifted songwriter, follower of Jesus.

13
00:01:30,880 --> 00:01:39,600
Had reached the pinnacle of his craft, of his ministry.

14
00:01:42,380 --> 00:01:51,040
And then in 2020, one of the most well-known and established pastors in the movement, Carl Lentz, pastor in New York,

15
00:01:51,040 --> 00:02:02,320
an individual who had brought in big-money people, big-name people, celebrities, Grammy-type folks, was fired.

16
00:02:04,040 --> 00:02:07,680
He was let go because of multiple infidelities over decades.

17
00:02:07,680 --> 00:02:13,400
He was accused of sexual abuse, something he denied, although he did admit the infidelity.

18
00:02:13,400 --> 00:02:18,520
And within two years, the founding pastor, Brian Houston,

19
00:02:18,520 --> 00:02:20,840
Huston, sorry,

20
00:02:20,840 --> 00:02:26,820
was accused of concealing sex abuse of minors

21
00:02:26,820 --> 00:02:31,600
and inappropriate relationships with two female staff.

22
00:02:32,480 --> 00:02:33,660
And he resigned.

23
00:02:33,660 --> 00:02:43,560
Within just weeks, nine of the 16 Hillsong churches in the U.S. closed.

24
00:02:43,560 --> 00:02:44,680
Mega churches.

25
00:02:44,680 --> 00:02:46,700
Closed.

26
00:02:46,700 --> 00:02:50,180
Go ahead and click the next slide.

27
00:02:50,180 --> 00:02:58,920
