28
00:02:59,500 --> 00:03:04,860
In the season of bravado, the season of silence, it's this sense of, I'm doing this.

29
00:03:04,860 --> 00:03:07,720
In the season of wonder, it's this confidence, I can do this.

30
00:03:07,720 --> 00:03:12,420
